        "filing_date": "2025-08-28",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To expand consumers' purchasing power, deliver personalized benefits through AdaptAI (Affirm’s AI-powered personalized promotion platform), and help them discover the best offers, we are delivering a new generation of financial products and experiences designed to meet their evolving needs.",
